{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:236","content":{"id":236,"title":"30 细胞之窗","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"247e202f-01a9-47f4-aeeb-c0beb0d60c1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何判断细胞是否应该被杀死："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"16051c9a-cb91-4466-9e06-009550adbcb4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eb99f5c6-1b83-4a63-8f65-f474cabdf8c5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91c7e712-9cec-4639-a6a7-3ba2806f44dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"被病毒入侵的细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e4efa500-9558-476f-a9ed-d2fd45377008","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fce8a0d1-7341-40e8-b5be-c4d6823c43b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有些细菌如结核分枝杆菌也可以入侵细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ab80d7fe-4c3c-4452-b8a8-cf1c22b76508","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ee0ab72-420d-4409-a83e-efc7c68c6aad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌细胞，标签上没有异常，实际内部已然坏掉"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9d014473-2c64-40fc-b67b-faa32318329f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af6c5a85-03ac-4c1c-b1cb-fa20a82dd02a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原生动物这些单细胞"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3327d28a-0a31-44df-a0e3-512881b67b50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想办法了解细胞内部，把细胞内的东西拿出来看看，一种起窗口作用的特殊分子，可以把细胞内部的情况呈现出来。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"58ed942b-8095-4441-b0ec-2877945ea8b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"I 型主要组织相容性复合体（MHC-I），所有包含细胞核的体细胞都有 MHC-I 类分子，细胞在回收蛋白时，会随机采集蛋白碎片，转运到细胞膜上，对外部呈现出来，这样就可以知道细胞内部情况，为确保都是最新情况，有成千上万个 MHC-I 类分子，每个 MHC-I 类分子大约一天换一个蛋白。并且在收到干扰素后，会开始生产更多的 MHC-I 类分子。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddfb6736-40a7-4528-941c-c7883b825fa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当免疫细胞发现细胞正在受到感染，这个受感染的细胞就会被杀死。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9cf803b2-8314-4163-a4ed-7fe3570b7a73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个人的 MHC-I 类分子都有些许的不同，这一点对器官移植很不幸，因为免疫系统通过 MHC 分子识别出移植的器官上的细胞不是你，免疫系统会发起攻击，杀死移植的器官。所以接受器官移植后，病人要终身服用强效免疫抑制剂，但这无疑会大大降低病人抗感染的能力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b68ed42-ac8a-4d93-b93f-0bc94425e3be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"30 细胞之窗","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:236","type":"doc","id":236}}],"prevPage":{"title":"29 化学战：干扰素，干扰起来！","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:232","type":"doc","id":232}},"nextPage":{"title":"31 专业杀手：杀伤性 T 细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:237","type":"doc","id":237}},"createTime":1741742757820,"updateTime":1743303640527,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640527}}